{"title": "Murderous Cloud of Daggers (area)", "pageid": 40205, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Murderous_Cloud_of_Daggers_(area)", "categories": ["Summoned areas", "Areas"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"min-height: 200px\" class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Murderous Cloud of Daggers (area) controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3d/Cloud_of_Daggers_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Murderous Cloud of Daggers</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Area\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">area</a> created by <a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Cloud_of_Daggers\" title=\"Murderous Cloud of Daggers\">Murderous Cloud of Daggers</a>. It creates a damaging area of blades that deals damage to all who enter it.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Spinning daggers fill the air. Anyone inside the whirlwind takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">6d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> each turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Murderous_Dagger_Cloud\"> Condition: Murderous Dagger Cloud </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Dagger_Cloud_(Condition)\" title=\"Murderous Dagger Cloud (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Cloud_of_Daggers_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Cloud_of_Daggers_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Cloud_of_Daggers_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Cloud_of_Daggers_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"M